53	 * have no ON DELETE action, so deleting a worn outfit raised a foreign-key
54	 * violation and the whole regeneration failed. Pinning is also the honest
55	 * product behaviour — what you actually wore today is not a suggestion to be
56	 * thrown away, so it keeps its place in the day's set and the fresh looks are
